'''Ratings Competition''' (昼ドラで競演, ''Hiru Dora de Kyōen'', '''Competing in a Soap Opera''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Accounting Power UP (Sm): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 10%.

